~ sign
Sign: This one lets you keep walking while it talks. Most things here do not. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_a6c3f9]
Sign: Cassie will not let you move. She needs you to stay. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_8eb642]
=> END


~ jar
$> advance_quest("jar")
## fairy, tree and shape each take it.
JAR. Something small inside scratches at the glass. It has been scratching for a long time. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_449063]
=> END


~ door_locked
Locked. Cassie has the key. She will not let go of it easily. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_7683cd]
=> END


~ door_open
$> advance_quest("help_cassie")
$> add_favor("cassie", 1)
## spend what cassie owes you by talking to her.
The door opens. Behind you, Cassie whispers a number. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_6cd491]
=> END


~ chest
ASPECT OF HATE. It is warm, like something just let go of it. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_ccc43c]
=> END


~ loaf
BREAD. Stale. Someone left it here for you. Stacks to 5. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_3c7df1]
=> END


~ pile
3 ASPECT OF HATE. They do not stack. The pile is always full again when you look back. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_e03a19]
=> END


~ pile_small
3 ASPECT OF HATE. This pile does not grow back. Something already ate the rest. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_66684b]
=> END


~ full
Your hands are full. They are shaking. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_cd81a0]
=> END


~ bread_used
Stale bread. It tastes like a kitchen you cannot picture anymore. You feel calmer. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_c3608e]
=> END


~ gate_locked
A locked gate. Roots hold it shut. They tighten when you touch them. Ask the tree. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_d0d94f]
=> END


~ gate_open
$> advance_quest("feed_tree")
The roots pull back. Slowly. Like they do not want to. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_64623f]
if get_debt("fairy") > 0
	$> add_sanity(-25 * get_debt("fairy"))
	$> set_fact("debt.fairy", 0)
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	## 25 sanity per fairy debt.
	Fairy: [#sanity_glitch] There you are. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_459e3d]
	Fairy: [#sanity_glitch] You owe me. I took it while you were looking at the roots. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_c5665f]
	Fairy: Check your hands. One of them is lighter than it was. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_25d976]
=> END


~ spring
$> add_sanity(10)
## once.
Water. Cold and clean. Your reflection moves a moment too late. You feel calmer anyway. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_57878a]
=> END


~ final_chest
End of the showcase. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_9a43c6]
if get_debt("tree") > 0
	$> add_sanity(-20 * get_debt("tree"))
	$> set_fact("debt.tree", 0)
	$> add_opinion("tree", -1)
	## 20 sanity per tree debt.
	Roots under the chest. The tree collects. It does not say sorry anymore. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_73a71e]
if get_favor("fairy") + get_favor("cassie") > 0
	Still owed to you. Fairy {{get_favor("fairy")}}. Cassie {{get_favor("cassie")}}. Spend it, before they decide you were never here. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_dc1743]
=> END


~ nail
if has_item("iron_nail") or is_quest_done("iron_nail")
	You already took the iron nail. The hole in the stump is still bleeding sap. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_d61d73]
	=> END
$> remove_item("aspect_of_hate")
$> give_item("iron_nail")
$> advance_quest("iron_nail")
IRON NAIL. The hate drains out of your hand into the wood. The wood lets go. Your hand stays cold. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_a2fadd]
=> END


~ nail_stuck
if not get_level_flag("showcase.nail_wanted")
	An iron nail in a stump. Nobody asked for it. Yet. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_22e413]
else
	It will not move without hate. The red pile has plenty. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_80ed8b]
=> END


~ shape
Something stands here. It has your face. It looks more like you than you remember looking. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_2470bf]
- Back away [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_dcc612]
	$> add_sanity(-10)
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "ran")
	You run. It does not follow. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_1c3991]
	% You hear it exhale. You do not have breath to spare. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_fb5096]
	% Behind you, something with your walk goes the other way. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_b1930c]
	% It is still standing where it was. It is also in front of you. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_34abe3]
## fake under sanity 50, bites at 50 or more.
- Touch it [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_eb3647]
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "touched")
	if get_sanity_zone() < 2
		Your hand goes through. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_b83cc3]
		% Nothing there. You are not sure there ever was. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_fbe98e]
		% It was cold. The cold of a hand that has been waiting. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_2234f9]
	else
		$> add_sanity(-15)
		It bites. It has your teeth. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_5fefb7]
		[#sanity_glitch] It chews. It is thinking. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_4f3952]
- Feed it bread [if has_item("bread") /] [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_1ebd55]
	$> remove_item("bread")
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "fed")
	It eats the way you eat. It watches you the whole time. Then it leaves. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_63f300]
- Open the jar at it [if has_item("jar") /] [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_fe2a79]
	$> remove_item("jar")
	$> advance_quest("jar")
	$> set_fact("choice.jar", "shape")
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "jar")
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	It takes what was inside. It leaves, and what it took screams the whole way. Somewhere, the fairy saw that. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_622cd3]
- Call in the fairy. Two favors. [if get_favor("fairy") >= 2 /] [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_2617c8]
	$> add_favor("fairy", -2)
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "favor")
	Fairy: [#sanity_glitch] Mine now. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_1c6041]
	Fairy: [#sanity_glitch] Do not ask what I do with it. We are settled. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_2ab065]
	You are not sure which of you left. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_9cbe73]
- Show it the nail [if has_item("iron_nail") /] [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_aa66d7]
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "iron")
	Iron. It flinches the way you would. It leaves. The fairy saw that. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_923e87]
=> END


~ idol_hungry
if get_quest_stage("idol") == -1
	$> advance_quest("idol")
	## it eats 5 sanity per second near it.
	Idol: Hungry. You will do. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_d75f35]
Idol: Three hate. Or stand here, and I take it out of you instead. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_748214]
- Feed it three hate [if has_item("aspect_of_hate", 3) /] [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_126bb4]
	$> remove_item("aspect_of_hate", 3)
	$> set_level_flag("showcase.idol_fed")
	$> advance_quest("idol")
	## interact again to push it over.
	Idol: Full. The stone cracks. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_22a4a3]
	Idol: There was something else in the hate. Did you notice? It is gone now. You can stop trying to remember it. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_2b64c7]
- Leave [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_bec261]
	Idol: Stay a little longer. I am patient. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_fad609]
=> END


~ idol
$> advance_quest("idol")
$> add_sanity(15)
It falls. The red drains out of the floor. You feel lighter, and you do not know what you lost. [ID:xyndj6m2nwcq_01cb69]
=> END
